flowchart TB
  subgraph Client[用户接入层]
    Web[Vue 3 管理端\nweb/src/views]
    Mini[uni-app 微信学生端\nminiapp/src/pages]
  end
  subgraph Api[后端应用层 FastAPI]
    Auth[auth 身份与角色]
    Knowledge[knowledge 知识库]
    Workflow[workflow 流程与申请]
    Notice[notice 通知触达]
    Exchange[exchange 文件交换]
    Report[report 学业与看板]
    Honor[honor 荣誉]
    Profile[profile 画像]
    Audit[audit 权限与审计]
  end
  subgraph Infra[基础设施层]
    DB[(Kingbase ES / PostgreSQL 兼容)]
    Redis[(Redis 锁与缓存)]
    Minio[(MinIO / 本地对象存储)]
    Mail[SMTP / MailHog]
    SMS[短信通道]
  end
  Web --> Auth
  Web --> Knowledge
  Web --> Workflow
  Web --> Notice
  Web --> Exchange
  Web --> Report
  Web --> Honor
  Web --> Profile
  Web --> Audit
  Mini --> Auth
  Mini --> Knowledge
  Mini --> Workflow
  Mini --> Notice
  Mini --> Report
  Mini --> Honor
  Mini --> Profile
  Api --> DB
  Notice --> Mail
  Notice --> SMS
  Api --> Redis
  Exchange --> Minio
  Workflow --> Minio
  Knowledge --> Minio
  Audit --> DB
